{"line":"T77.C.01","text":"C’est le sens d’origine. « AGI » a été popularisé dans les années 2000 (Gubrud, Goertzel, Legg) comme le contraire de l’IA étroite : un seul système pour beaucoup de domaines, face à un moteur d’échecs. Ça ne disait rien du niveau. Selon cette lecture littérale, les elle-elle-emme remplissent la condition, et Norvig et Agüera y Arcas ont soutenu exactement ça en 2023.","lufs":-19.09,"alignment":{"characters":["C","’","e","s","t"," ","l","e"," ","s","e","n","s"," ","d","’","o","r","i","g","i","n","e","."," ","«"," ","A","G","I"," ","»"," ","a"," ","é","t","é"," ","p","o","p","u","l","a","r","i","s","é"," ","d","a","n","s"," ","l","e","s"," ","a","n","n","é","e","s"," ","2","0","0","0"," ","(","G","u","b","r","u","d",","," ","G","o","e","r","t","z","e","l",","," ","L","e","g","g",")"," ","c","o","m","m","e"," ","l","e"," ","c","o","n","t","r","a","i","r","e"," ","d","e"," ","l","’","I","A"," ","é","t","r","o","i","t","e"," ",":"," ","u","n"," ","s","e","u","l"," ","s","y","s","t","è","m","e"," ","p","o","u","r"," ","b","e","a","u","c","o","u","p"," ","d","e"," ","d","o","m","a","i","n","e","s",","," ","f","a","c","e"," ","à"," ","u","n"," ","m","o","t","e","u","r"," ","d","’","é","c","h","e","c","s","."," ","Ç","a"," ","n","e"," ","d","i","s","a","i","t"," ","r","i","e","n"," ","d","u"," ","n","i","v","e","a","u","."," ","S","e","l","o","n"," ","c","e","t","t","e"," ","l","e","c","t","u","r","e"," ","l","i","t","t","é","r","a","l","e",","," ","l","e","s"," ","e","l","l","e","-","e","l","l","e","-","e","m","m","e"," ","r","e","m","p","l","i","s","s","e","n","t"," ","l","a"," ","c","o","n","d","i","t","i","o","n",","," ","e","t"," ","N","o","r","v","i","g"," ","e","t"," ","A","g","ü","e","r","a"," ","y"," ","A","r","c","a","s"," ","o","n","t"," ","s","o","u","t","e","n","u"," ","e","x","a","c","t","e","m","e","n","t"," ","ç","a"," ","e","n"," ","2","0","2","3","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.08,0.1,0.12,0.14,0.16,0.187,0.213,0.24,0.3